85
00:03:09,793 --> 00:03:11,355
That gives the trapezoidal rule:

86
00:03:12,038 --> 00:03:14,181
h over two, times the first height, plus

87
00:03:14,282 --> 00:03:16,826
two times every inside height, plus the last

88
00:03:16,887 --> 00:03:17,086
